  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large pan, heat 1 tablespoon of oil over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the chicken breast and cook for 5-6 minutes on each side, until cooked through.",
    "3. Let the chicken rest for 5 minutes before slicing it into thin strips.",
    "4. In a large bowl, combine the julienne lettuce, red onion, cucumber, and chili peppers.",
    "5. In a small bowl, whisk together the light soy sauce, fish sauce, and lime juice.",
    "6. Add the sliced chicken to the bowl and pour the dressing over the top.",
    "7. Toss everything together to combine.",
    "8. Season with salt to taste.",
    "9. Garnish with minced garlic and serve immediately."
